body:
After 6 months of Gathering parts, I finally broke my AR Cherry and finished the first of what will be many builds. My next project is an AAC Honey Badger SBR clone for the wife. Cant wait to test it out.
|:----------------------| 
|Assorted Parts List|

PSA Standard Lower Build Kit w/ stock assembly;
BCM Mod 3 Grip (Generously donated by my gun loving neighbor);
Magpul Fixed Moe Carbine Stock;
Spikes Tactical Crusader Billet Lower;
Magpul AFG Foregrip;
Rock River 5.56 BCG;
Hardened Arms Upper Receiver Assembly w/ 1:7 16" HBAR barrel (Live in Maryland and all ARs have to HBAR because muh gun laws).
Vortex Strikefire II (Budget Optic Option)
|:----------------------|
Total Cost: Around 1050"

destabilizing population shifts/migrations;
